1	//! `ShaderDriver` — the CognitiveShader IS the driver.
2	//!
3	//! Holds BindSpace columns (owned), the p64 CognitiveShader topology (8
4	//! predicate planes) plus its bgz17 PaletteSemiring (O(1) distance table),
5	//! and an optional sink. `dispatch()` runs one cycle end-to-end.
6	//!
7	//! ```text
8	//!   ShaderDispatch
9	//!         │
10	//!         ▼
11	//!  [1] meta prefilter  (cheap u32 column sweep)
12	//!  [2] resolve style   (auto-detect from qualia if Auto)
13	//!  [3] shader cascade  (p64 CognitiveShader + bgz17 distance)
14	//!  [4] cycle signature (Hamming-folded fingerprint of the top-k)
15	//!  [5] edge emission   (CausalEdge64 per strong hit)
16	//!  [6] FreeEnergy gate (Flow/Hold/Block from active-inference F)
17	//!  [7] sink            (on_resonance → on_bus → on_crystal)
18	//!         │
19	//!         ▼
20	//!  ShaderCrystal
21	//! ```
22	//!
23	//! No forward pass, no JSON, no allocations beyond top-k + edges.
